:: OC James Intro Quest Part 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 30>>
You walk through the entrance into the boardwalk. It is nearly empty, mostly filled with employees and staff setting things up or the occasional early bird wandering around. The boardwalk is mostly known for its night life, with bright blinking lights and sounds, so while it is open this early, it usually doesn’t see much action until around lunch time, when families or tourists start to show up. However, as you walk towards the abandoned shop where you’ll meet <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span>, you notice something. The area is closed off with tape and barriers, with a large sign that says: <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Area closed for cleaning.”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC James",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>


<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Strange, isn’t it?”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">You jump at the sudden appearance of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> directly behind you.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! Sorry! I thought you saw me!”</span> He quickly apologizes. The two of you head towards the barrier, a lone security guard lazily sitting away nearby who only gives you a curious glance. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“In all my weeks of investigating this place, I’ve never seen it roped off or closed… or even cleaned, for that matter. Probably a good thing, that area is kind of gross. But this is just more proof! Someone knows we are onto them!”</span> <br>
<br>
You admit that it is rather suspicious, but you also don’t think jumping to conclusions right away is the best idea. It could be a coincidence. You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> what the plan is now, should you try again next weekend? <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No way!”</span> He responds quickly, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We’re so close! We can’t back out now, then they’ll win!”</span> He glances towards the guard, who is reading a dirty magazine. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Follow me!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> grabs you by the arm and leads you around the stalls and buildings to a side alley. This area is roped off as well, with the same sign displayed, but it doesn’t have anyone guarding it. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If we’re quick, we’ll be fine.”</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="Choice1">
	<<link "Ask why he’s so obsessed<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice1">>
        You ask why he’s so obsessed with discovering what is going on and he quickly blushes, stumbling out an answer. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ho- how are you not!? It’s a mysterious shop that whips your memory! Pl- plus who knows whose inside! What secrets we’ll find!”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">You understand his reasoning, but get the feeling there is something else he isn’t telling you, but you decide to drop it for now and ask what the plan is.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <<include "OC James Intro Quest Part 2.2">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Agree<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice1">>
        <<include "OC James Intro Quest Part 2.2">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>

:: OC James Intro Quest Part 2.2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Here’s the plan!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> lays it out like it’s some master stroke of strategy, when in reality it’s pretty simple. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“One of us will keep watch from behind these trashcans, so we can see the entrance, and the other will go in. Whoever watches will use this camera to record everything, trying to see if anyone else is inside. The one who goes in will try to stay within view of the entrance and yell out what they see, so we can record it. That way we can get some information to work off! Sound good?”</span> <br>
<br>
<div id="Choice2">
	<<link "Sounds good!<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice2">>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">You nod, the plan seems sound since you have so limited information.</span> You agree and ask who will be doing what. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We- well, I figured I’d let you pick. I don’t mind doing either, so whichever you are more comfortable with.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <<include "OC James Intro Quest Part 2.3">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "That plan is terrible<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice2">>
        <span style="color:LightCoral">You tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> that plan is terrible! Walking right into the den of whoever is behind this! That’s crazy!</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, it’s all I can think of! I’ve tried everything else on my own! Setting up a camera, looking for a back door, even dressed up as a pizza delivery guy and knocked! Nothing works! The only thing I haven’t tried is going in with someone else watching my back.”</span> He sighs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I know it isn’t the best plan, but it’s all we can do until we know more! You can do the watching, if you want. I’ll take all the risk”</span> He gives you a desperate smile and you sign, relenting and agreeing to help him. <br>
        <br>
        <<include "OC James Intro Quest Part 2.3">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>

:: OC James Intro Quest Part 2.3 [nobr]

/* Intro */

<div id="Choice3">
	<<link "James goes in<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice3">>
        You decide that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> will be the one to go in as you watch from back here. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> nods, looking a tad nervous, and hands you the camera. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just keep it on me for as long as you can. I’ll do my best to stay within sight!”</span> You both share a nod, plan in place, and you get into your position hidden behind the trashcans. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> runs to the end of the alley, peeking both ways to ensure the security guard or anyone else won’t see him, before sprinting across towards the abandoned shop. <br>
        <br>
        You press record on the camera, aiming it directly at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> as he sneaks over slowly. He turns back to you, giving a thumbs up before moving towards the door. Then something strange happens. <span style="color:BlueViolet">You notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> straighten up and begin to walk, almost robotically, towards the door. He reaches down and opens it, revealing the completely dark insides. You zoom in, trying to get a better view, but can see nothing but darkness.</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">Then <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> starts to walk in, not looking back once or trying to stay within sight as he vanishes into the shadows!</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 2,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:LightCoral">You feel your hair stand up on end as the door slowly shuts behind him, having consumed <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> completely. This wasn’t part of the plan, you think about running over to help him, but find your feet feeling like jelly. Something in your chest, dread or fear maybe, is making you unable to stand up.</span> So, you sit there, camera recording and facing the door, waiting and praying that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> will come out soon. <br>
        <br>
        <<linkreplace"Continue">>
            You have no idea how long you are waiting for, frozen and staring at the camera screen pointed towards the dusty old door. There has been no sign of movement, no sign of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span>, and every minute just causes more dread to seep in until… <br>
            <br>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey!”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">The sudden voice and hand on your shoulder makes you jump, letting out the loudest scream you’ve ever made. Your body cowers, rolling onto your back and trembling from the built-up fear suddenly all racing to the surface.</span> You open your eyes, worried about what you’re going to see, but find the security guard looking down at you angrily. Under his arm is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span>, looking groggy and half asleep. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Can’t you brats read the sign? Get out of here!”</span> <br>
            <br>
            The guard scoops you up in his other arm, carrying you both off like naughty children and tossing you roughly to the wooden floor far past the security line. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If I see you both try something like that again, I’ll call the police! Got it!?”</span> <br>
            <br>
            You take the disoriented and confused <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> as far away from the shop as you can, to the other side of the boardwalk to some tables and chairs. You grab him a water and ask him what happened? You saw him go inside, he acted strange, then nothing! What happened? How did he get out? <span style="color:Yellow">The rising anxiety in your chest is about to explode if you don’t get answers.</span> <br>

                <<set _ad to [
                    {
                        Name: "Player",
                        State: {
                            Mouth: "Frown",
                        },
                    },
                    {
                        Name: "OC James",
                        State: {
                            Outfit: "Everyday",
                            Eyes: "Tired",
                            Mouth: "Frown",
                            Blush: 1,
                        },
                    },
                ]>>
                <<ad _ad>>

            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I- I don’t know…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> rubs his eyes, acting like he just woke up from a long nap. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Di- did I go inside? I can’t remember…”</span> He groans, rubbing his head. You quickly pull out the camera and play back the recording, showing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> going stiff and walking inside, not once looking back to you. He watches in confusion, holding his head as he tries to remember what happened. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I… I remember we made the plan and…”</span> He groans, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I don’t know! After that I woke up in the middle of the tunnel of love. The security guard was waiting for me when the ride ended, said he saw me sneak on. Then…”</span> <br>
            <br>
            He pauses, thinking for a moment, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He heard someone on his radio, said there was another kid hiding around the closed off area. Then we headed straight to you.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> starts to think, wondering about the voice on the radio. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“How did that-? Why don’t I-?”</span> He groans loudly, slumping down in his chair, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So we learned nothing! What a waste!”</span> <br>
            <br>
            You think for a moment, claiming that may not be true. <span style="color:BlueViolet">You’ve both learned, for a fact, that something strange, maybe supernatural, is happening with that shop. What’s more, the security guards may be in on it, how else were you both discovered so easily!?</span> <br>
            <br>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Then what do we do!? If that guard sees us creeping around again, we’ll be in big trouble!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> asks. You explain that you’ll meet back here after 8PM, when the boardwalk is at it’s busiest. That guard shouldn’t be on the clock anymore and with so many people, the two of you will be able to sneak over. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You’re right…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> smiles, a plan forming in his head, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I think I know what we can do! I have to go get some stuff, I’ll meet you back here tonight!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> quickly rushes off, his energy and determination returned as an idea forms. <br>
            <br>
            <span style="color:Yellow"> All you have to do now is return tonight and wonder what exactly you are getting involved in.</span> <br>
            <<socialChange "James" 5 1>>
            <<set $ActiveQuests.delete("James: The Orange Mystery Part 1.2")>>
            <<set $ActiveQuests.push("James: The Orange Mystery Part 1.3")>>
            <<for _i to 0; _i lt $QuestLog.length; _i++>>
                <<if $QuestLog[_i].Name == "James: The Orange Mystery Part 1">>
                    <<set $QuestLog.deleteAt(_i)>>
                    <<break>>
                <</if>>
            <</for>>
            <<set $QuestLog.push(
                {
                    Name: "James: The Orange Mystery Part 1",
                    State: 1,
                    ID: "OCJames_M001",
                    Category: "Character",
                    Type: "Quest",
                    Icon: "James",
                    Tags: ["James", "Orange", "Character", "Quest", "Boardwalk"],
                    Description: "You have agreed to help your classmate <span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">James</span> investigate the <span style=\"color:Teal\">Mysterious Abandoned Shop</span> at the <span style=\"color:Teal\">Boardwalk</span>. After some investigating, you've decided to return after dark. You need to meet <span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">James</span> at the <span style=\"color:Teal\">Boardwalk</span> on <span style=\"color:Teal\">Saturday</span> between <span style=\"color:Teal\">8PM</span> and <span style=\"color:Teal\">10PM</span>.",
                    Objectives: [
                        {
                            Name: "You need to meet <span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">James</span> at the <span style=\"color:Teal\">Boardwalk</span> on <span style=\"color:Teal\">Saturday</span> between <span style=\"color:Teal\">8PM</span> and <span style=\"color:Teal\">10PM</span>.",
                            State: 0,
