	<<link "You go in<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice3">>
        With a deep yet unsteady breath, you decide to go in yourself. You’re unsure if you can trust your own mind at this point, but know that being able to see and experience this phenomenon first-hand while knowing will be your best bet at discovering what is going on. You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> share a nod and he gets into position, aiming the camera at the door as you take one last deep breath before moving forward. <br>
        <br>
        You creep to the end of the alley, peeking both ways to ensure neither security guard nor cleaner is around to see you. Once you are sure it is clear, you quickly sprint to the other side, stopping along the side of the shop. It is old, rotting, and dark. No signs of life nor that anyone has ever cleaned it. You look back to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span>, seeing the slight glint of the camera hidden behind the trashcans. You give him a thumbs up before turning to the front door and stepping towards it. <br>

