        <span style="color:BlueViolet">The instant you reach for the doorknob, something happens. You can’t explain it; it’s like when you try to remember falling asleep. It’s just one second, you’re awake, and the next…</span>  <br>
        <br>
        <<if $PlayerUndies.Type != "None">>
            <span style="color:Pink">A sharp pain on your balls, between your butt cheeks-! You are startled awake by the pain, the pain of a wedgie!</span> Your eyes spring open, you find yourself still at the boardwalk, but somewhere else. A few families walk by, a young boy laughing and pointing at you as his mother chuckles. You feel weird, you can’t feel the ground beneath your feet. <span style="color:Pink">You look down to find that you are off the ground, hanging, dangling!</span> <br>

                <<set _ad to [
