            <span style="color:Pink">Ouch! You groan from the pain, suddenly realizing why your balls ache! You are hanging by your underwear! You turn around, seeing your $PlayerUndies.Type hooked around the target of the dunk tank game. You pull on it, trying to free yourself, but find it is hooked tightly around it! You pull with all your might when suddenly – snap! – the underwear is yanked free and you fall to the ground painfully.</span> <br>
            <br>
            You sit up with a bruised nose, confused and groggy. You feel like you just woke up from a long, deep nap. Where are you? What are you doing here? And how did you end up hanging by your underwear? You try to remember, desperate for answers, <span style="color:LightCoral">when you suddenly hear someone shout out to you.</span> <br>
