                    <<ad _ad>>

            <span style="color:Pink">Your ass is cold and as you adjust and rub your eyes, you feel an uncomfortable breeze on your balls. You look down confused and are instantly startled to your senses as you realize you are sitting on the ground with your bottoms around your ankles, your precious boy bits exposed! You yelp, quickly pulling up your clothes to cover yourself as another man walking by laughs.</span> <br>
            <br>
            What on earth happened!? How did you end up next to the dunk tank with your pants down and your balls out!? You try to remember, desperate for answers, <span style="color:LightCoral">when you suddenly hear someone shout out to you.</span> <br>
            <<set _arousalbp to []>>
