            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“There you are, little brat!”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">The security guard from earlier grabs you by your wrist and painfully drags you to your feet.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“They said I’d find you hear, stupid kids!”</span> You see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span>, staring at you in both worry and relief, also held by the guard. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We saw you sneaking around, so don’t even try to act like you don’t know what I’m talking about!”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">The guard swats you both on the butt with his blackjack, causing a sharp pain that sends you both trembling forward.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“If I see you in the closed off area again, I’ll call the police! Get out of here!”</span> <br>
            <br>
            <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> quickly takes you by the arm and runs off, not wanting to risk the guard giving you both another smack. He takes you over to some tables and chairs on the far other side of the boardwalk, quickly getting you some water to calm your confused mind. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What happened!? I saw you go in, you were acting strange and robotic. Then you never came out!”</span> That’s when you remember what you were trying to do, sneaking into the shop. <span style="color:Yellow">But… but you can’t remember anything past reaching for the doorknob.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Here, look!”</span> <br>
            <br>
            <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">James</span> pulls out the camera and shows you video of you walking in, just like he said, but you move almost like a robot, like a character in a video game. Then, you disappear into the darkness, and the door shuts behind you on its own. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I waited for like 30 minutes, but you never came out. Then the guard found me, just about gave me a heart attack when he grabbed me. Then, on his radio, someone said ‘the other kid is at the dunk tank’! That’s where we found you!”</span> <br>

